# What docker build never sends when it builds from the repository root (deploy/Dockerfile). Keep keys, local state
# and installed packages out: admin/node_modules from a Mac would replace the image's own (different platform).
# The local stack builds backend/ on its own (backend/.dockerignore).
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.egg-info
**/.venv
admin/dist
deploy/environments/*.local.conf
deploy/environments/*.url
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate*
docs
serenade
local
.DS_Store
